            <ArticleTitle>Soft-Template Construction of 3D Macroporous Polypyrrole Scaffolds.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/smll.201604099</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A bottom-up approach toward 3D hierarchical macroporous polypyrrole aerogels is demonstrated via soft template-directed synthesis and self-assembly of ultrathin polypyrrole nanosheets in solution, which present interconnected macropores, ultrathin walls, and large specific surface areas, thereby exhibiting a high capacity, satisfactory rate capability, and excellent cycling stability for Na-ion storage.</AbstractText>
